55	 * outside canvasElement, so the assertion queries within(document.body) with this inline citation
56	 * — testing.md §Layer-2's only sanctioned use of that query, matching zimmDrawer/index.stories.tsx's
57	 * own precedent for a different portal (Drawer, not a toast).
58	 */
